      {
        "id": "3974532637448288798",
        "type": "Image",
        "shortCode": "DcoYGAzTToe",
        "caption": "Celebrating Dolly has me thinking about the joy of reading books and how often I squander that pleasure by putting myself under pressure to consume pages. \n\nWe are all craving deep reading, deep thinking, and deep connection — and these all require deep time. \n\nI went back this morning and re-read the interview we did with @mayasmarty and was drawn to her phrase the “privilege of focus.” \n\nLet’s start a spiritual book club where we read what we want, when we want, no meetings or deadlines - just a shared reframe of deep time as subversive in a world of shallow distraction, addictive scrolling, and unrelenting attention grabbing. ❤️📖❤️",
